      "content": "The feeling that you are stealing his life is a symptom of the exhaustion you're feeling, not the truth of your worth. Your life matters, and you deserve relief from this constant weight of perceived obligation. If you are truly at a point where you feel this is the only selfless choice, please know that there is immediate, compassionate help available to talk through these thoughts. You can call or text 988 anytime to speak with someone who can support you through this intense pain.",
